      "updated": 1785568566598,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Once user login, it will fetch all product nearest to the location distributed center\n- once order is done it trigger kafka to update Inventory, payment service, shipping, notification\n- Idempotency: A user may click \"Place Order\" multiple times. check the customer already has order\n- for scaling we can add load balancer\n- again for DB scaling -> sharding, replica, partitions\n- for list order, we can use cache",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Once user login, it will fetch all product nearest to the location distributed center\n- once order is done it trigger kafka to update Inventory, payment service, shipping, notification\n- Idempotency: A user may click \"Place Order\" multiple times. check the customer already has order\n- for scaling we can add load balancer\n- again for DB scaling -> sharding, replica, partitions\n- for list order, we can use cache",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
